            "pre_update_notes": "A small patch on top of 2.0.3. It applies 1 tiny data migration that rewrites the links inside existing admin bell notifications (it touches only the notifications table \u2014 not your products, orders or customers). If you use the Airwallex hold-until-shipped option, read the changelog entry first: before this release it charged the card immediately."
